# Read the guide first

Before changing Nirnside, read `docs/NIRNSIDE.md` (how data flows, where
it is stored, the principles, the game model, how to add knowledge, the
release flow). Game rules and facts live once, in `src/lib/game/`
(`docs/game-model.md` maps them): look there before writing any list or
rule about the game, add missing ones there with a source and a test, and
move any copy you find onto the model.
